{"thread":{"threadID":4078,"boardID":117,"topic":"Upgrade unserer Server","time":1484092689,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","lastPostTime":1484144540,"lastPoster":"Saitama","replies":13,"views":391,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":12},"tags":[{"tagID":281,"name":"Community"},{"tagID":207,"name":"csgo"},{"tagID":984,"name":"deutsch"},{"tagID":28,"name":"jail"},{"tagID":295,"name":"knife"},{"tagID":138,"name":"Server"},{"tagID":1019,"name":"upgrade"}],"posts":[{"postID":58898,"threadID":4078,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"Upgrade unserer Server","time":1484092689,"lastEditTime":1484097077,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":12,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":2391,"username":"??NN!!","time":1484092888,"value":1},{"userID":335,"username":"Cornflakes","time":1484095283,"value":1},{"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","time":1484111300,"value":1},{"userID":2369,"username":"Luckiris","time":1484113516,"value":1},{"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","time":1484130619,"value":1},{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1484133678,"value":1},{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1484135845,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1484142754,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1484144454,"value":1},{"userID":2039,"username":"Wario","time":1484144660,"value":1},{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1484148643,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1484172290,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>wie ihr unschwer mitbekommen habt, hatten wir heute ein paar Downtimes und nachträglich ein paar Probleme bezüglich Stamm / Credits.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das liegt daran, dass wir vorhin unsere Server upgraded haben.<br>Wir haben bei unserem Rootserver nun:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>einen stärkeren Prozessor</li>\n<li>doppelte Anzahl an RAM (64GB DDR4 ECC statt vorher 32GB DDR3)</li>\n<li>doppelte Festplattenkapazität (ermöglicht uns mehr Freiraum für neue und bestehende Projekte und war einer der Gründe, wieso wir geupgraded haben)</li>\n<li>eine Erhöhung unserer Bandbreite von 250MBit auf nun 1 GBit/s, was ein lagfreieres Spielen und besseren Schutz gegen DDoS Angriffe ermöglicht</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Inzwischen sollte alles, wie vor dem Wechsel schon, problemlos funktionieren. Für euch fallen keinerlei Nachteile an, keine neuen IPs oder ähnliches. Ihr habt nur Vorteile <span class=\"missing-media\">[;)]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir haben noch einige interessante Dinge für euch geplant, seid gespannt <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58900,"threadID":4078,"userID":335,"username":"Cornflakes","subject":"","time":1484095278,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>das hört sich super an !:)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58904,"threadID":4078,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1484112061,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Richtig gut!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58905,"threadID":4078,"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","subject":"","time":1484116756,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Heftig!!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Minecraftserver?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58907,"threadID":4078,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1484119237,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1484133993,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1484142791,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>So wie ich das einschätze haben wir mit dem neuen Root weitreichend mehr Kapazitäten und die Möglichkeit die Serverstruktur sowie die Community nachhaltig auszubauen! Das ist ein toller und wichtiger Schritt in die richtige Richtung! Vielen Dank an dieser Stelle an die (Co-)Leader <span class=\"missing-media\">[&lt;3]</span><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>YellowWonderchild</strong></cite><p>Minecraftserver?<br></p></blockquote><p>Hatten wir zwar bereits, aber mit der neuen Hardware könnte dies endlich ein ruckelfreies Spielerlebnis werden, dass sicherlich nicht nur ich befürworten würde +1</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Noch ein paar weitere Ideen, welche vielleicht in naher Zukunft eine Rolle spielen könnten:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>GarysMod: TTT | DarkRP<br>Lws2017<br>GTA</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58908,"threadID":4078,"userID":2199,"username":"OxygeN","subject":"","time":1484123594,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Great to hear this news <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>My dream of cs 1.6 server will happen? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58911,"threadID":4078,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1484130081,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das ist ja schön und gut aber mal im Ernst, was bringt euch/ uns ein Upgrade wenn die meisten Server leer sind?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58912,"threadID":4078,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1484132784,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","time":1484133486,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Stabiler Jesus</strong></cite><p>Das ist ja schön und gut aber mal im Ernst, was bringt euch/ uns ein Upgrade wenn die meisten Server leer sind?<br></p></blockquote><p>Das sie High-performance-leer sind <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58913,"threadID":4078,"userID":2368,"username":"Helimir","subject":"","time":1484133727,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Find ich super <span class=\"missing-media\">[^^]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58914,"threadID":4078,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1484134669,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hab gehört ihr updated jetzt jeden Server auf 128Tick? <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58918,"threadID":4078,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1484136200,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2368,"username":"Zelimirus","time":1484588288,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Finde es gut das es ein Upgrade gab. So kann man wieder neue Spieler mit anderen Spielen erreichen z. B. wenn ein Gmod Server gemacht wird oder so. Freue mich schon auf die neuen geplanten Dingen. Was geil wäre, ein Arma 3 Server im Roleplay still aber halt eher weniger Altis Life <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":58919,"threadID":4078,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"","time":1484136978,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","time":1484137129,"value":1},{"userID":54,"username":"Craxto","time":1484142819,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Yey...can we get more stuff in the shop now cause of the more hard disk space? please :3 (you don&#x27;t need to model everything just add them from the mod thingy you got now)</p>"